ccessful response still refreshes contact but supplies false to notifyAll\"\n      ],\n      \"async_boundaries\": [\n        \"Blocking Transport.AppendEntries call\",\n        \"Separate worker from ordinary replication\",\n        \"stopCh/timer/notification select\"\n      ],\n      \"produces_fact_ids\": [\n        \"f-heartbeat-contact\"\n      ],\n      \"consumes_fact_ids\": [],\n      \"cross_activity_effects\": {},\n      \"existing_protections\": [\n        \"Verification notification uses response Success, not mere RPC completion\",\n        \"Ordinary replication separately detects newer response terms\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"s-heartbeat\",\n        \"s-spawn\",\n        \"s-append-response\"\n      ],\n      \"unknowns\": [\n        \"Transport response production, timing and cancellation under network fast path need exact reading.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b-lease-consume\",\n      \"primary_activity\": \"A2\",\n      \"execution_owner\": \"Raft main thread\",\n      \"protocol_context\": \"Latest configuration voter set and current leaderState replication objects\",\n      \"trigger\": \"checkLeaderLease invocation\",\n      \"legal_preconditions\": [],\n      \"implementation_guards\": [\n        \"Counts only Voter servers\",\n        \"Counts local server directly\",\n        \"Counts remote timestamps only within leaseTimeout\"\n      ],\n      \"reads\": [\n        \"configurations.latest.Servers\",\n        \"followerReplication.LastContact()\",\n        \"LeaderLeaseTimeout\"\n      ],\n      \"writes\": [\n        \"Raft state becomes Follower if recent contacted voters are below quorum\"\n      ],\n      \"durable_effects\": [],\n      \"external_effects\": [],\n      \"important_branches\": [],\n      \"async_boundaries\": [],\n      \"produces_fact_ids\": [],\n      \"consumes_fact_ids\": [\n        \"f-heartbeat-contact\"\n      ],\n      \"cross_activity_effects\": {},\n      \"existing_protection